Run the confirmed open crop-field example through exact SCL clipping, candidate retry, calibrated reflectance and the urban gate:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x preprocess-field \
  --input examples/preprocessing_crop_field_request.json \
  --output outputs/preprocessing_crop_field_result.json
```

Verified live result:

```text
Original-range scene S2C_44PMC_20260723: spectral-validity 7.69% → rejected
Expanded scene S2B_44PMC_20260628: field-valid 100%, spectral-valid 100%
Quality: MEDIUM
Urban gate: pass
Final status: accepted
```

A blocked GPS input stops before any catalog/raster work:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x preprocess-field \
