The live fallback reports terrain-corrected VV/VH dB evidence and never pretends SAR is an optical vegetation index.

## Orbit, Doppler, ITU-R and Scheduled-contact Simulation

This is split into two honest scopes:

1. agriculture scene provenance/pass planning through live TLE + SGP4;
2. a separate X-band link/contact simulator that requires calibrated inputs and never claims to control Sentinel transponders.

```bash
PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x fetch-tle \
  --norad-id 40697 --output outputs/sentinel2a_tle_live.json

PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x predict-passes \
  --input examples/sentinel2a_guntur_pass_request.json \
  --output outputs/sentinel2a_guntur_passes.json

PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x atmospheric-loss \
  --input examples/atmospheric_loss_guntur_xband_validation.json \
  --output outputs/atmospheric_loss_guntur_xband_validation.json

PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x simulate-contact-traffic \
  --input examples/traffic_120_station_validation_only.json \
  --output outputs/traffic_120_station_validation_only.json
```

The Sentinel reference uses documented X-band mission context; `8.2 GHz`, EIRP, noise temperature and 120-station traffic in the included examples are explicitly caller-supplied validation fixtures, not operational ESA parameters. Latest TLEs are rejected for the historical 2026-06-28 scene because the epoch gap exceeds seven days; an authorized historical TLE is required. TLE/SGP4 is orbital prediction, not live beacon telemetry.

## Set 3 Analytics & Set 4 Diagnosis

```bash
PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x analyze-field \
  --preprocessing outputs/preprocessing_crop_field_result.json \
  --set1 outputs/set1_crop_field_scene_aligned.json \
  --output outputs/analytics_crop_field_result.json

PYTHONPATH=src python -m satellite_x diagnose-field \
  --analytics outputs/analytics_crop_field_result.json \
  --quality MEDIUM \
  --sowing-date-quality known \
  --output outputs/diagnosis_crop_field_result.json
```

The current real run computes all seven indices, chilli DAS/stage, rain–ET0 deficit, transparent evidence, Telugu action and confidence. See `SET3_SET4_GOVERNANCE_REPORT.md`.

